Package: rox-filer2
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: josejp2424 <puppylinuxjosejp2424@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @SHLIBS_DEPENDS@, shared-mime-info
Recommends: pkexec, libgtk-layer-shell0, libsmbclient0, cifs-utils, samba-common-bin, samba, fuse3 | fuse, jmtpfs, libmtp9t64 | libmtp9, gphoto2, gphotofs, libgphoto2-6t64 | libgphoto2-6, ifuse, usbmuxd, libimobiledevice-utils, libimobiledevice-1.0-6, feh | xwallpaper
Suggests: udisks2
Provides: rox-filer, file-manager
Conflicts: rox-filer
Replaces: rox-filer
Homepage: https://github.com/josejp2424/ROX-Filer-gtk3
Description: lightweight GTK3 file manager and desktop environment component
 A fast continuation of the original ROX-Filer for GTK3.
 It includes the Rox-Filer2 Desktop, wallpaper and desktop application
 management, drive icons, paired filer windows, ROX File Search, XDG MIME
 integration, custom actions, Trash support and file templates.
